{"id":"558542113","kind":"article","title":"遗忘","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-08-27","updated":"2026-10-29","votes":11,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":421,"keywords":["遗忘曲线","干扰","指数遗忘","间隔重复","记忆模型","SuperMemo"],"summary":"译文将遗忘定义为知识逐渐从记忆中消失，并把干扰视为主要机制；针对简单神经网络中的原子知识，SuperMemo 数据呈现指数型遗忘曲线。词条随后列出相关的遗忘曲线、机制与神经统计模型文章，并展示基于 14,550 次复习绘制的数据图。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/558542113","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"R5uLNird\"><b>遗忘</b>是知识逐渐从记忆中消失的过程。遗忘的主要原因是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。对于简单神经网络中的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Complexity\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原子知识</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>而言，干扰将导致<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting_curve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">指数型遗忘</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。这已被 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup> 所收集到的数据所证实。</p><p data-pid=\"kkrnxMwT\">欲了解更多，请参阅：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"Tb70N1HJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting_curve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘曲线</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"eU9zHCj7\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Mechanism_of_forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘机制</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"JlGoY40_\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neurostatistical_model_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆的神经统计学模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"qJn5kkgP\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Exponential_forgetting_via_interference_in_a_Hopfield_network\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hopfield 网络中的干扰导致的指数型遗忘</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"acroTkv_\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Error_of_Ebbinghaus_forgetting_curve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线的错误</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ef5d178367356356603a071682a45926\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-ef5d178367356356603a071682a45926_r.jpg\" width=\"500\"/><figcaption>Exponential forgetting curve collected with SuperMemo 17</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"KfFYaTcM\">图：经过相当于 6 次<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最佳间隔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>复习后的，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup> 学习材料的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting_curve\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">指数型遗忘曲线</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。绘制的图表包含 14,550 次复习。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"MMlvzyMX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Forgetting - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">词汇表</a>条目用于解释 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_Guru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo Guru</a> 系列中关于记忆、学习、创造力和问题解决的文本。</blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 记忆复杂性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"304800091\" href=\"#/post/304800091\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 遗忘曲线 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"274352214\" href=\"#/post/274352214\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 什么是SuperMemo <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 遗忘机制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"265081034\" href=\"#/post/265081034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 记忆的神经统计模型 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"277483881\" href=\"#/post/277483881\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线的错误 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"156672476\" href=\"#/post/156672476\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\